seed 348
use binding-files

grant
  grant read catalog::constructors to ann with grant option
  grant read catalog::relations to ann with grant option
  grant read_files to ann
  grant read catalog::constructors to bob with grant option
  grant monitor to ann

as ann register cat-1.0 pins 3 edition "2026-10" lease 8d use ctors

revoke
  revoke read catalog::relations from ann
  revoke read_files from ann
  revoke monitor from ann
  revoke read catalog::constructors from bob
